## Third-party components

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own source. Some dependencies are
distributed under other licenses and are not covered by it.

### Mozilla Public License 2.0

MPL-2.0 is file-level copyleft. Section 3.3 permits distributing a Larger Work
under a different license provided the MPL-covered files themselves remain under
MPL-2.0. These dependencies are used unmodified, so their license applies to them
and not to this repository's source.

Reachable at runtime, via @nself-web/og and the edge function that renders Open
Graph images:

  satori 0.0.46                  MPL-2.0
  @resvg/resvg-wasm 2.0.0-alpha.4  MPL-2.0
  @vercel/og 1.0.0               MPL-2.0

Build and development only, not shipped and not executing at request time:

  lightningcss                   MPL-2.0  (@tailwindcss/postcss, Expo/Metro)
  axe-core                       MPL-2.0  (jest-axe, @storybook/addon-a11y)
  @edge-runtime/*, edge-runtime  MPL-2.0  (@vercel/node, devDependency)

### Everything else

A scan of 1,628 packages across all six workspace apps, the Cargo manifests for
the Tauri desktop app, and all sixteen internal @nself/* and @nself-web/*
packages found only MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD and ISC. No GPL, AGPL, LGPL, SSPL,
CC-BY-SA, BUSL, Elastic or proprietary licenses appear in any dependency path.

Re-run a dependency license scan before changing the license of this repository.
A permissive license claim is only valid if the dependency graph supports it.
